24
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,200
Wan'er ?

25
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,160
Wan'er !

26
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,360
No !

27
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,640
It's him...

28
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:34,280
You still haven't found your soul strand ?

29
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,960
Perhaps you're fated to die here.

30
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:41,080
Burn !

31
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,200
Stop !

32
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,920
I can't let him harm Wan'er's soul strand.

33
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,680
It's you !

34
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,720
A Soul Flag ?

35
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,680
If you make one more move,

36
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:05,880
