37
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,160
Damn it,

38
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,880
this place is collapsing.

39
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,280
I'll need to find another method to get my soul strand.

40
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,960
If this place collapses,

41
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:24,960
Wan'er's soul strand will die too.

42
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,000
Merge !

43
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,960
Thank you for your help, little friend.

44
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,970
My only way to find her soul strand

45
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,760
is to keep destroying the spirit's body.

46
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,240
You saved me

47
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,760
and then you attacked me.

48
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,000
What's wrong with you !?

49
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,000
Destroy !

50
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:53,800
Wan'er !

51
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:55,760
Where are you ?

52
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,520
Madman !

53
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,160
You're insane !

54
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,080
Destroy !

55
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,800
Wan'er !

56
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:37,960
Wan'er...

57
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,040
Don't be afraid.

58
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,360
Metal Souls' Basin
Suzaku Tomb

59
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,360
The collapse is accelerating.

60
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,360
I must find the central mountain,

61
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,600
reclaim my soul strand,

62
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,480
and then I escape this place.

63
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,200
This is...

64
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,280
Metal soul strands ?

65
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,600
Xu Liguo !

66
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,960
My grandkids,

67
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,760
don't you dare provoke your grandpa Xu !

68
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,080
Escaping ?

69
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,560
Did I say you could escape ?

70
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,360
A spirit formed from metal soul strands

71
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,960
resembles a Sword Spirit.

72
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,560
That means Xu Liguo can counter them.

73
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,360
This aura...

74
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:01,320
It's strikingly similar to a celestial sword.

75
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,480
Such powerful pressure !

76
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,880
This blade is made of a single soul strand, not multiple.

77
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,400
Swords have their pride

78
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,120
and blades have their fury.

79
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,160
This is no ordinary weapon.

80
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:29,760
I want

81
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,080
your Sword Spirit.

82
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,360
You

83
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,720
can leave.

84
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,920
No no no !

85
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,000
This blade is really fast,

86
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:01,840
the same speed as the 4th primary soul.

87
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,640
But its attacks are stronger.

88
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,040
Leave

89
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,560
him here !

90
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,360
Ceng Niu,

91
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,960
thanks to you distracting the metal soul strands,

92
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,560
I was able to pass safely.

93
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,240
Since that's the case,

94
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,960
I'll leave you a little gift.

95
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,160
Didn't you want a rematch with Ceng Niu ?

96
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,400
I'll give you that chance today.

97
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:34,680
Kill him.

98
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,760
This half-moon blade doesn't try to harm Xu Liguo.

99
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,320
Maybe it has other intentions ?

100
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,080
Xu Liguo,

101
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,970
bear with it

102
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,210
for a moment.

103
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,640
Master !

104
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,120
You can't !

105
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:59,080
A devil like you won't die easily.

106
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,680
Once I reclaim my soul strand,

107
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,080
I'll come back for you.

108
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:05,640
Don't you dare forget to save me !

109
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,000
This blade is a treasure.

110
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:10,280
When I come back for Xu Liguo,

111
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,560
I need to subdue it too.

112
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:15,240
Central spirit mountain outskirts
Suzaku Tomb

113
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,680
This must be the mountain.

114
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,160
Red Butterfly !

115
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,440
Qian Feng refined her into his cauldron

116
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,200
and she's lost her consciousness.

117
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,520
I don't have much time,

118
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:40,080
I have to deal with her fast.

119
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,640
Can you

120
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,320
kill me ?

121
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,560
She's still conscious !

122
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,680
I...

123
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,600
I can't

124
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:18,000
control myself.

125
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,560
I don't want

126
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,640
to live like this.

127
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,120
I beg you,

128
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,760
kill me !

129
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,040
I, Red Butterfly,

130
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,760
would rather die

131
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,880
than live in shame.

132
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:05,240
In my centuries of cultivation,

133
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,120
you were one of the few people

134
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,920
that I, Wang Lin, considered a rival.

135
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:12,760
I never imagined that our final battle

136
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,440
would end up like this.

137
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:19,760
I admire your pride and your spirit.

138
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
I will grant

139
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,760
your wish.

140
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,480
Do it.

141
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:32,640
Looking back at my youth,

142
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:32,640
I was the rising star of Xue Yue.

143
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,320
100 years to reach Soul Formation

144
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,840
but I was forever stuck at Soul Formation.

145
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,160
And now I'm a puppet

146
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:40,160
100 years to Soul Formation,

147
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:40,160
will I be remembered or forgotten ?

148
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,440
and have no hope of freedom.

149
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,880
My only way to be free

150
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:44,000
It doesn't matter who plays white or black,

151
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:44,000
the game is unpredictable.

152
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:41,920
is death.

153
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,600
All of the discarded pieces

154
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,600
are equally illusory.

155
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:46,520
I lived less than 200 years.

156
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:52,840
When the mind is empty and dies,

157
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:52,840
it forgets that the violence of the chessboard

158
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,400
Life is like a butterfly,

159
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,760
gone in an instant.

160
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,040
But that instant

161
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:56,680
was not in vain.

162
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,440
is unforgettable.

163
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,440
Farewell...

164
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:10,840
My past life's wounds are willing to become

165
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:10,840
a butterfly landing on your shoulder.

166
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:18,800
I will face this disaster and break my chains.

167
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:18,800
I will never give up my pride.

168
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:24,480
This is our karma,

169
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,480
my death was inevitable.

170
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:28,080
I seek my liberation this very moment.

171
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:32,960
Please remember me...

172
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,320
Qian Feng's domain

173
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:35,560
is endless desire.

174
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:39,560
He devours domains to understand them

175
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,320
and refine his own domain.

176
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:47,040
I leave you my insights of his domain and the Soul Lasher.

177
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:48,360
Ceng Niu,

178
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,440
help me.

179
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,720
Kill Qian Feng.

180
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,600
Please...

181
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,320
Next spring,

182
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,640
a blue rose will bloom

183
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,760
in the northern plains.

184
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:04,560
That is my gift to you.

185
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:17,120
I promise.

186
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:48,040
By using the Void Ancestor's Skull,

187
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:50,480
I'll open a passage to the Suzaku Tomb.

188
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:52,240
Only one person can enter

189
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,480
and time is limited.

190
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,920
If you don't exit before the tattoo fades,

191
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:59,040
you'll be erased.

192
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:00,880
Who goes ?

193
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,440
I will.

194
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:12,840
Once I find the Cultivation Planet Crystal,

195
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,680
I'll use a reverse formation to repair it

196
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,280
and prevent the arrival of the Cultivation Alliance.

197
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,360
I will protect our clan.

198
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:22,880
It will be dangerous,

199
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,000
be careful.

200
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,440
Come back safely.

201
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:34,480
Central spirit mountain entrance
Suzaku Tomb

202
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,160
Is this the place ?

203
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:33,640
Be patient, just a little longer.

204
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:35,840
How much longer exactly ?

205
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,320
Yunque Zi was able to breach the barrier and enter the tomb ?

206
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,280
Impossible...

207
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,080
That's right,

208
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,960
how did he do it ?

209
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,160
Greetings, Senior.

210
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:55,520
Senior,

211
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:57,280
Junior has been waiting for you.

212
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,480
This door

213
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,000
is impossible to open.

214
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,040
Don't worry,

215
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:06,040
this is the only path to the first Suzaku's tomb.

216
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,880
But it won't open without

217
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:09,320
the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

218
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:13,960
We need to wait a bit more for the collapse of the Suzaku Tomb

219
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,440
and the door will open,

220
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,560
allowing us to enter.

221
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:29,880
He's not from planet Suzaku...

222
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:32,640
Although he's Peak Late stage Soul Transformation,

223
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:35,680
I still have a strange feeling about him.

224
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:39,240
May I know which fellow cultivator possessed this body ?

225
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:41,440
Show me your true form.

226
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:47,080
We've never met.

227
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:49,040
Even if I reveal myself,

228
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:51,840
you won't know who I am.

229
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,320
Step back !

230
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,440
Stay away from the spatial rifts !

231
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,640
How did it start collapsing ?

232
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:03,960
The Suzaku Tomb

233
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,120
has almost completely collapsed.

234
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:15,160
That Zi Xin bitch !

235
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,640
He's still not here...

236
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,240
Ceng Niu,

237
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:32,320
I hope Heartless sent you off to hell.

238
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:39,240
Brother Wang !

239
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,240
Ceng Niu !

240
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:41,840
Wang Lin...

241
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,640
We're finally reaching

242
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:05,320
the climax of the game.

243
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:29,740
To let go of the consequences of my actions

244
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:31,460
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

245
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:33,400
like scattered ink.

246
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:40,880
As destiny falls

247
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:40,880
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

248
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:48,480
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

249
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:48,480
wither and melt into rivers.

250
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:56,040
Who can deceive

251
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:56,040
the law of the heavens ?

252
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:59,360
Countless generations

253
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,360
have tried before me.

254
00:17:59,650 --> 00:18:03,080
But how could I not catch my dreams

255
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:03,080
within my warm fingers ?

256
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:07,160
You're at my side when I'm alone

257
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,480
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

258
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:14,440
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

259
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:18,640
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

260
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,640
in the streets.

261
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:23,600
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

262
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:23,600
Can I break the rules ?

263
00:18:23,610 --> 00:18:26,320
To run towards you !

264
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:29,640
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

265
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:34,280
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

266
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:37,680
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

267
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:42,360
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

268
00:18:42,810 --> 00:18:48,040
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

269
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:51,960
If your soul is willing to wander,

270
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:56,600
can I still take your hands

271
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:56,600
and hold them tight ?

272
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:59,680
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

273
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:04,560
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

274
00:19:04,570 --> 00:19:07,840
I dream of destroying

275
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:12,560
the shackles of our fate.

276
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:16,520
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

277
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:19,320
You're the hardest to let go of.

278
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:23,200
I want to be with you again

279
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:26,560
so I can look in your eyes.

280
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:31,800
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
